<view class="gift-page"><view class="gift-heading"><view class="gift-kicker">MAKE IT YOURS</view><view class="gift-title">选好尺码，收下心意。</view></view><brand-loading wx:if="{{loading && !card}}" label="正在同步礼品…"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="gift-error">{{error}}<button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新核对</button></view><block wx:if="{{card}}"><view class="gift-card"><view class="gift-card__body"><image src="{{card.image}}" class="gift-card__image" mode="aspectFit"/><view><view class="gift-card__name">{{card.productName}}</view><view class="gift-card__meta">{{card.description}}</view><view class="gift-card__meta">{{card.statusLabel}}</view></view></view></view><block wx:if="{{card.canRedeem}}"><view class="gift-section"><view class="gift-section__title">选择尺码</view><view class="gift-sizes"><button class="gift-size {{size === item.size ? 'active' : ''}} vk-button-content" wx:for="{{sizes}}" wx:key="size" data-size="{{item.size}}" bindtap="selectSize" disabled="{{busy || !item.canRedeem}}">{{item.size}}{{!item.canRedeem ? ' · 暂缺' : ''}}</button></view><button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="sizeGuide">查看我的尺码档案 ↗</button><view class="gift-note">固定 {{card.quantity}} 条，使用同一尺码。库存按尺码共用，确认兑换时再次核对。</view></view><view class="gift-section"><view class="gift-section__title">收货地址</view><view class="gift-address" wx:if="{{address}}">{{address.name}} · {{address.phone}}<view class="gift-section__copy">{{address.province}}{{address.city}}{{address.district || ''}}{{address.detail}}</view></view><button class="gift-secondary vk-button-content" bindtap="chooseAddress" disabled="{{busy}}">{{address ? '更换地址' : '选择或新增地址'}}</button></view><view class="gift-section"><view class="gift-amount"><text>商品款项</text><text>礼品卡已包含</text></view><view class="gift-amount"><text>本次运费</text><text>{{shippingFeeCents === null ? '待选择地址' : '¥' + shippingFee}}</text></view><view class="gift-note">发货时间以商品当前预售／配送安排为准。优惠券和积分不参与礼品兑换。</view></view></block><view class="gift-notice" wx:if="{{card.status === 'REDEEMING'}}">商品无需再次付款，本次配送订单待支付运费。可继续支付，或取消后重新选择尺码和地址。</view><button class="gift-primary gift-confirm vk-button-content" bindtap="submit" wx:if="{{card.canRedeem || card.status === 'REDEEMING' || card.status === 'REDEEMED'}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || (card.canRedeem && (!size || !address))}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{card.status === 'REDEEMED' ? '查看配送订单' : card.status === 'REDEEMING' ? '继续支付运费' : shippingFeeCents ? '确认兑换并支付运费 ¥' + shippingFee : '确认兑换'}}</button><button class="gift-link vk-button-content" wx:if="{{card.status === 'REDEEMING'}}" bindtap="cancelDelivery" disabled="{{busy}}">取消配送订单，重新选择</button><view class="gift-notice" wx:if="{{card.status === 'REFUND_PENDING' || card.status === 'REFUNDED' || card.status === 'VOID'}}">卡片暂不可兑换，请联系赠礼人或客服核对。</view></block><button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="goService">尺码、配送或售后问题？联系客服 ↗</button></view>
<privacy-sheet id="privacy-sheet"/>
